  skillDescription: "<color=#FFD700>Base (3★):</color> Does not attack and taunts nearby ranged enemies. When taking damage, heals up to 2 operators in range (including himself). If a blocked enemy is stalled for 20s, the enemy becomes Enraged: gains +35% ATK, but loses 5% max HP per second until defeated.\n<color=#FFD700>1st upgrade (4★):</color> Automatically heals operators in range if their HP is below 50%, and expands taunt range by 1 additional tile radius.\n<color=#FFD700>2nd upgrade (5★):</color> Expands healing range and reduces Enraged enemy damage by 10%."
