  intelQuote: Go on, hit me. It helps.
  intelLore: "A massive, gentle moose whose pelt and antlers have completely fused with living moss and fungal flora from a flooded culvert in Railyard Drain. Completely unbothered by the apocalyptic ruins, Mossmo never raises a hoof to attack, yet enemies can't resist charging it\u2014only for every blow against its thick hide to disperse soothing blooms that mend nearby allies."
